{"id":"n71111-3-5","stage":1,"title":"음 · 哦","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71111-3-5-1","ko":"나는 학교 다닐 때 만날 일등만 했어.","zh":"我上学时总是考第一。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"다닐","meaning":"上学、就读","explanation":"학교에 다니다 是“上学”；다닐 때 在这里表示“上学的时候”，说的是过去的学生时代。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다닐","audio":"/audio/255e8ded76b2f909559e.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"만날","meaning":"天天，常常，老是","explanation":"만날：天天，常常，老是。","readings":[{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50307","senseId":"1","lemma":"만날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}},{"text":"일등만","meaning":"只得第一名","explanation":"일등 是“第一名”，-만 表示“只”；原词典例句将 일등 误分写为 일 등，这里已校正。","readings":[{"term":"일등","audio":"/audio/c7f5593273c09d9a209e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70782","senseId":"1","lemma":"일등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일등만","audio":"/audio/19c272f3a2ff8c037308.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"得了第一名","explanation":"하다 在“일등을 하다”中表示取得某种结果；했어 是过去时非敬语，这里是“得了第一名”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"06e9ab2bbb32c974","term":"만날","zh":"天天，常常，老是","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3","entryId":"50307","definition":"几乎一天不停地。","pronunciation":["만ː날"]},{"id":"c7f5593273c09d9a","term":"일등","zh":"第一名","audio":"/audio/c7f5593273c09d9a209e.mp3","entryId":"70782","definition":"成绩或比赛名次居第一；本句说上学时总拿第一。","pronunciation":["일뜽"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"取得","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"获得某种结果；本句指取得第一名。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e854f5650715fa143b1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71111-3-5-2","ko":"음, 네가 정말 그랬단 말이야?","zh":"嗯，你当时真的总拿第一？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嗯？","explanation":"음 在这里带有不太相信的语气，接着追问对方是否真总得第一。","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"3","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬단","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬단","audio":"/audio/0ff1a4504397f69b33eb.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야?","meaning":"是说……吗","explanation":"-단 말이야? 用来追问、确认刚听到的话；这里是“你当时真的总拿第一？”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"嗯？","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","entryId":"71111","definition":"听到对方自称总拿第一名时，表示半信半疑。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话、意思（-단 말이야）","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"与前面的引述形式连用，追问或确认对方说的内容。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/797b75da83845035b4bc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71111","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5202,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我上学时总是考第一。","嗯，你当时真的总拿第一？","听说您经常去博物馆？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我上学时总是考第一。","嗯，你当时真的总拿第一？","听说您经常去博物馆？"],"answer":1}]}
